WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.960
Present day high school student Saburo
is taken back in time to the Warring States period,

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.030
where he takes the place of Nobunaga Oda.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.930
and wins an unlikely victory
in the Battle of Okehazama.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:13.900
And then...

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.530
I'll take Mino.

00:00:16.810 --> 00:00:17.680
Right!

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.130
Win minds to win castles.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.000
So this is what is called
a "political strategy."

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.420
He conquered the impenetrable
Inabayama Castle without any battles.

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:32.470
And that is how he took the
hometown of his wife, Kichou.

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:40.500
It has been a long time, Father.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.570
It's pretty quiet here.

00:00:44.570 --> 00:00:48.430
Maybe we should move him
somewhere more lively.

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:49.790
His grave.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:55.810
My father lived and died
in troubled times.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:04.400
From now on, I want him
to rest peacefully in a quiet place.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:18.740
Dousan-san...

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:23.020
I took Mino.

00:01:24.170 --> 00:01:26.110
That's okay, right?

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:34.150
My lord, what is that bird called?

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.910
Isn't it a duck?

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:39.990
Most things in ponds are ducks.

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.080
Um, my lord, that's an egret!

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:44.620
It's an egret.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:47.550
An egret?

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:52.920
What a beautiful bird.

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:01.550
My rice balls!

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:05.390
Wait!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.230
My rice balls!

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:13.320
Give them back! My rice balls!

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:28.860
Well, rats.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.520
This is probably bad.

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:32.960
What should I do?

00:02:54.870 --> 00:02:57.900
I apologize for being rough.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:02.690
However, you were
far too easy to abduct.

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:06.640
You are not aware of your
position as a leader!

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:10.980
I don't want to be
lectured by a kidnapper!

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:14.030
Well, that will be enough for today.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:19.800
I brought you here to meet a man.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:25.510
His name is Mitsuhide Akechi.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.130
Mitsuhide Akechi?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.220
Long time no see.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:48.780
The real Nobunaga!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.010
Mitsuhide Akechi

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.010
Episode 6

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.550
So, you have the baton now.

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.850
Good luck conquering Japan.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:10.680
Ah, what a relief!

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:13.890
I can finally stop being Nobunaga.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:22.980
Wait, what do I do now?

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:26.570
I don't know how to get back
to my own age.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:28.370
I'll have to find a job.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.340
But then there's Kichou...

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:36.400
Huh? This is getting pretty messy.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.670
I apologize.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:42.850
I cannot go back
to being Nobunaga now.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:46.380
It was you who built
the Oda family as it is today.

00:04:50.490 --> 00:04:53.080
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:57.330
It would be pretty confusing
to switch back now.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:05.150
Oh well, I guess I'll take responsibility
and go on being Nobunaga.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:06.360
I thank you.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:10.280
So, why did you come
to see me, anyway?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.580
I would like to be of use to you.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:24.170
I have come belatedly to ask for
your permission to serve you.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:35.060
Please, allow me to live under you
as the retainer Mitsuhide Akechi.

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:46.530
So, today I want you all
to meet someone.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:49.770
His name's Mitsuhide Akechi-kun.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.050
Come on in!

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:59.040
Why is he wearing a hood?

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:02.290
Why do you hide your face?

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.690
I have a sickness of the lungs.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:11.620
I dress this way so that
I do not spread it to you.

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:13.550
I hope you understand.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:17.890
My lord, who exactly is this man?

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:19.840
Who cares about that?

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.040
It's his private business.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.070
Pr—?

00:06:23.070 --> 00:06:28.170
I believe I can be of assistance to
Nobunaga-sama's entry into Kyoto.

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.730
Into Kyoto?

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:32.760
Yep, yep.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:37.690
Akechi-kun says he's acquainted
with Yoshiaki Ashikaga-san.

00:06:40.220 --> 00:06:44.060
Yoshiaki-sama aspires
to become shogun.

00:06:44.740 --> 00:06:50.130
He is searching for a daimyo to establish him
by entering Kyoto with him.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:52.880
I see!

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:56.390
We enter Kyoto to make him shogun.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:59.250
It is a perfect pretext, indeed.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.650
Yeah, pretty much.

00:07:02.600 --> 00:07:06.760
The Oda family's goal is to
conquer Japan, after all.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.240
I figure maybe it's about time
we go to Kyoto.

00:07:14.980 --> 00:07:17.720
Were you happy with
that introduction?

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.890
Yes.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:22.960
Now we just need
to follow our plan.

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:26.330
That mask looks annoying.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.210
Aren't you sweaty?

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.420
No need to worry.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:33.380
I feel kind of bad.

00:07:33.380 --> 00:07:36.300
You have to be masked, just
because we have the same face.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:37.440
No, no.

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:41.890
It's because we have the same face
that you ended up becoming Nobunaga.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:43.580
Oh, yeah.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.440
Guess I don't need to apologize.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.780
Oh, Micchi—

00:07:48.970 --> 00:07:50.280
"Micchi"?

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.110
Call me Saburo, okay?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:55.450
"Saburo"?

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.830
My real name.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:01.050
Nobody calls me Saburo.

00:08:01.050 --> 00:08:04.580
I feel like I might forget
my own name.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:10.080
So when there's no one else around,
at least you can call me Saburo.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.220
I understand. Saburo.

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:18.870
Is "Micchi" going to be
my common name?

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:21.810
Brother!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.980
I captured a white snake
in the yard.

00:08:25.380 --> 00:08:28.480
You didn't have to show it to me.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.770
But it's so cute!

00:08:31.770 --> 00:08:34.480
Oh yeah, I have
something to tell you.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.570
Yes?

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.260
No!

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:45.540
Why do I have to marry into
the Azai family of Oumi?

00:08:47.370 --> 00:08:51.460
Oumi's along the way to Kyoto.

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:56.100
I thought maybe we should have
Azai-san on our side —

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.190
Hmph!

00:08:57.490 --> 00:09:02.050
Well, I think it'd be good
for you, too.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:05.950
Nagamasa-kun has a pretty
good reputation as a warlord.

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:07.120
And his face!

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.770
They say he's pretty handsome.

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:12.860
The face isn't what matters in a man!

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:17.730
Oh.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:20.270
In any case, <i>no</i> means <i>no.</i>

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:24.250
I'm most happy
when I'm by your side!

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:30.080
What now, Micchi?

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.460
My brother!

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.760
This feels good.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:37.010
Be careful, Oicchan.

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:38.590
Right!

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:42.620
My sister was so little.

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:47.310
Now she has grown up quite,
well, headstrong.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.320
My lord!

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:56.760
What brings you here today?

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:01.560
I just wanted to see if the people
of Owari are doing well.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:04.100
Please let us know if you
ever need anything from us.

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:06.130
Sure! Thanks.

00:10:09.260 --> 00:10:12.930
Do you come here to Owari often?

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:14.070
Yeah.

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:17.770
It's easier to know how people are doing
if you actually see them.

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:21.350
To conquer Japan, you have
to start locally, right?

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.060
I see.

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:31.860
The lord is well-liked.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:39.820
One could not govern a state by
neglecting its citizens, much less of all Japan.

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:44.430
The lord is well aware of that.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:51.910
Protecting the state and
protecting the family is not an easy task.

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:59.750
That is why I came to the Oda family,
to be of use to Lord Nobunaga-sama.

00:11:01.240 --> 00:11:03.260
To be of use to my brother?

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:15.560
I simply must do my part
in the Oda family's pursuit of power.

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.740
Oh! I have spoken too long
to a princess.

00:11:23.210 --> 00:11:24.370
You...

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:28.500
You resemble my brother.

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:33.950
It's your voice!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.170
My voice?

00:11:45.690 --> 00:11:47.690
Oicchan!

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:49.710
We're going home.

00:11:52.320 --> 00:11:54.370
It's getting pretty late.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:56.980
Brother!

00:12:01.140 --> 00:12:05.070
If I marry, will it help you?

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:07.550
Huh?

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:13.710
Yeah, it would.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:15.880
It would help.

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:19.700
If you get married,
we can go to Kyoto.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.380
Then I'll do it!

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.090
I'll marry that Azai or whatever.

00:12:25.860 --> 00:12:27.590
I will marry.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:33.620
For you and for the Oda family,
I will marry!

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:34.810
Oicchan.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:43.620
<i>You're</i> Nobunaga Oda?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:47.950
Top candidate for successor to the shogun,
Yoshiaki Ashikaga.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:50.870
Yeah. Hiya. Nice to meet you. Hello.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:57.850
I was expecting, you know,
a more gallant, manly man.

00:12:57.850 --> 00:13:01.210
Can I really depend on you? Eh?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:05.520
You can't judge a man by his looks!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.350
At least, according to my sister.

00:13:11.420 --> 00:13:12.720
Your sister?

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.150
Well, just watch.

00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:18.750
You want me to make it to Kyoto safely
and make you shogun, right?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.690
I'm leaving tomorrow.

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:22.320
What? Tomorrow!

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:22.970
Yes.

00:13:22.970 --> 00:13:24.860
I'm all prepared.

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:28.890
I'll just have you wait here.

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:31.620
I'll send some men
when things are settled.

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:38.150
Okay, Kichou, I'm leaving now.

00:13:38.620 --> 00:13:39.710
All right.

00:13:40.270 --> 00:13:41.700
Nobunaga-dono!

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:46.920
Hey, Ieyasu-kun.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:49.470
Thanks for the support forces.

00:13:50.480 --> 00:13:51.470
Oh, no.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:56.520
I am honored to be able to participate
in your glorious entry to Kyoto.

00:13:56.990 --> 00:14:04.120
Besides... your wife
is really, really beautiful.

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.320
My lord!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:16.160
All our men are prepared.

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:20.740
Well then, everyone. To Kyoto!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.600
What is the matter, Ikeda-dono?

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:53.140
You may not know this, Akechi-dono,
but until just recently,

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:57.620
the Oda family was nothing more
than affluent landowners in Owari.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:04.960
To think that now, we are approaching
Kyoto with such a massive army!

00:15:05.510 --> 00:15:07.350
I am overwhelmed.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.340
Tsuneoki.

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:17.470
Believe it or not,
the lord used to be sickly.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:22.740
One day, he became strong,
as though he were a different person.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:25.980
Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:28.490
Move!

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.110
Yeah!

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:33.660
Energy charge!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.500
Literally, bug repellant!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.160
I'm sick of being Nobunaga.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.090
Master!

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:47.560
It has been difficult
following such a lord.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:53.340
Nobunaga will become
ruler of the land!

00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:58.520
But it has been well worth the effort.

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:02.310
I have burdened you, Tsuneoki.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:09.600
But I, with my weaknesses, might not
have been able to carry the Oda family.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:14.580
That young man who appeared
before me by chance that day

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:20.010
may have been a god of salvation
sent from the heavens for the Oda family.

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:26.050
Having entered Kyoto,

00:16:26.050 --> 00:16:30.590
Saburo drove the Miyoshi Three
from power in Kyoto into Awa, Shikoku.

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:35.010
Then he forced the other influential man,
Hisahide Matsunaga, to surrender.

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:42.350
So, what will it take for
Yoshiaki-san to become shogun?

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.500
This is sudden, as always.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.310
Yeah.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:50.370
We will have to go to
the court, I believe.

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:51.670
Indeed.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:59.490
You must go to court, and submit a petition
on behalf of Yoshiaki-sama for ascension to the shogunate.

00:17:00.840 --> 00:17:04.130
Okay! I'll get going, then.

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:05.370
Going? Where?

00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:07.540
The court, right?

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.300
But we must write the
letter of petition first!

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:15.260
And are you even aware of
the etiquettes of the court?

00:17:15.570 --> 00:17:17.220
Etiquettes?

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.780
Do those matter?

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:20.860
I just have to bow and stuff, don't I?

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:27.560
The famous Nobunaga Oda
is coming here soon.

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:29.860
I wonder what kind of man he is.

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.980
Just a country boy, I am sure.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:36.030
He will look and behave
tastelessly, of course.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:41.660
Samurai have been barbaric
and shaggy since olden times.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:55.290
Say, who is that person?

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:57.600
Nobunaga Oda-sama.

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:03.560
How was the court?

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.600
Was it fun?

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:09.640
Well, it was not <i>fun</i>.

00:18:09.640 --> 00:18:12.000
Do you think the shogun
thing will work out?

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.240
It should not be a problem.

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:19.900
Got it. Okay, thanks a lot.

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:25.200
But I did not think
I would have to go to court.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:27.960
Nice idea, right?

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:33.120
It's a good way make use of the fact
that we have the same face.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:37.590
So, I'm leaving it to you
to deal with the court.

00:18:38.620 --> 00:18:39.800
Understood.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:46.980
And so, the fifteenth Muromachi shogun,
Yoshiaki Ashikaga, was born.

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:51.480
My father!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:56.320
I am grateful for the efforts
you have made for me.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.200
I am astounded by your genius.

00:19:01.050 --> 00:19:06.540
I may have misheard,
but did you just say "my father"?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.790
I did! I did, indeed!

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:11.870
I have decided to call you Father,
as a gesture of respect.

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:15.340
Please don't.

00:19:17.560 --> 00:19:22.050
Oh, I know!
How about the title of Adjutant Shogun?

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:24.550
Doesn't that just make you
want to dance?

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:28.310
I don't think I'll need that.

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.590
Why not?

00:19:31.590 --> 00:19:33.630
Adjutant Shogun!

00:19:33.630 --> 00:19:37.520
I'm going to be ruler of all Japan.

00:19:37.520 --> 00:19:39.480
I don't need to be Adjutant Shogun
or anything.

00:19:42.910 --> 00:19:46.080
All right, then.
I'm going home to Mino.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.170
You're going home?

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:48.570
You're going home already?

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:51.870
Yeah. My work here is done.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.720
But what about me?

00:19:53.720 --> 00:19:56.360
Will I be okay in Kyoto without you?

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.980
Well, you deal with it yourself.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.530
You are the shogun, after all.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:14.220
And in the blink of an eye,
the Oda army left Kyoto.

00:20:16.810 --> 00:20:19.900
Honnouji

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:21.570
Hey, it's Honnouji!

00:20:22.340 --> 00:20:24.270
Is this temple important?

00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:27.530
This is where Nobunaga gets killed.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:33.820
It's called the Honnouji Incident
or something. It's pretty famous.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.000
My lord!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.130
You are not making sense again.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.240
Honnouji Incident?

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:41.560
Oh, yeah! And the killer was...

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.040
A...

00:20:52.490 --> 00:20:53.950
A... person?

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:55.980
Who was it? I forget.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:04.860
If that so-called Honnouji Incident
is truly going to happen, I will stop it.

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:09.080
I will not allow anyone to kill you.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.540
You're so reliable, Micchi!

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:21.060
And that was the beginning of the concerto
of the two Nobunagas.
